maya: FYI sample app encountered an auth failure surfaced inconsistently across SDKs. Need quick harmonization.
sam: examples?
maya: iOS: {"error":"Unauthorized","detail":{"code":401,"msg":"token expired"}}; JS: HTTPError(status=401, body:"Unauthorized") — hard to handle uniformly.
jordan: also seeing 429s from Dedicated with no Retry-After header. devs get no guidance.
liam: proposal: typed errors across SDKs: AuthError (401/403), RateLimitError (429 + retry_after_seconds), ServiceError (5xx). Add stable internal_code and human_message + docs_url. Keep http_status for compat.
sam: non-breaking approach: add new fields on errors behind a feature-flag for 2w, then flip.
jordan: i'll add e2e tests in sampleapp asserting typed exceptions.
liam: ops-bot: infra needs to include Retry-After header on 429 responses.
ops-bot: Created INF-512 (P2) to add Retry-After header.
maya: owners: sam (SDK + sample snippets), liam (server headers), jordan (tests + docs). i'll run canary and watch telemetry. devex-bot: can you add an adoption dashboard?
devex-bot: Created dashboard "error_shape_adoption" and watcher for legacy-shape spikes.
sam: onboarding snippet we'll add:
```js
try {
  await client.generate();
} catch (err) {
  if (err.code === 'auth_error' || err instanceof AuthError) {
    await refreshToken(); // retry once
  } else if (err instanceof RateLimitError || err.retry_after_seconds) {
    // backoff using err.retry_after_seconds or exponential backoff
  } else {
    throw err;
  }
}
```
maya: small UX rule: sampleapp should log only human_message + correlation_id, avoid full stack dumps.
liam: timeline: PRs by EOW, server header rollout early next week, feature-flag on for 2w, monitor canary.
maya: thanks all. sam open the PR and include changelog + sampleapp changes. :rocket:
